queries. The whole 16-test integration suite, availability included, ran in about 400 ms on a small dataset. It was not measured at seed scale. |\n| NFR-4 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | There is no UI to check |\n| NFR-5 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | No UI was written, so there is no mui-mcp lookup trail |\n| NFR-6 | PASS | The only new dependency is `@dnd-kit/core` pinned at 6.3.1; `next lint` (no-restricted-imports) is clean |\n| NFR-7 | PASS (API) | All 10 handlers call `requireUser` or `requireRole` before the service runs, and per-entity checks run on the server (`assertCanViewTimetable`, `resolvePersonalTarget`). There are no server pages yet. |\n| NFR-8 | PASS | Handlers follow `withHandler` → `parseBody`/`parseQuery` (Zod) → service → `ok()`; CONFLICT is used for clashes and for period delete-with-slots |\n| NFR-9 | PASS | Reuses `http.ts`, `audit()` and `logger`; service at src/server/timetable/timetable-service.ts; no renames |\n| NFR-10 | PASS | `tsc --noEmit` and `next lint` are clean. `vitest run`: 133 pass, 1 fail, in the same 3 files that failed before SH-6, so nothing regressed. |\n| NFR-11 | PASS | tests/unit/timetable-clash.test.ts and tests/unit/timetable-time.test.ts (21/21) |\n| NFR-12 | PASS | tests/integration/timetable-concurrency.test.ts (written by QA) |\n| NFR-13 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | `tests/e2e/timetable.spec.ts` is missing, and there is no UI to drive |\n| NFR-14 | PASS | grep finds no `console.log` in any SH-6 file; the service uses `logger.warn` |\n| NFR-15 | PASS | No solver, multi-week cycle, substitute or holiday code; there is only a holiday hook comment in `getScheduleForDate` |\n| NFR-16 | NOT-IMPLEMENTED | There is no UI or print output to check |\n\n## Tests written by QA\n\n- `tests/integration/timetable-concurrency.test.ts` has 16 tests running against real Postgres.\n- It skips without `TEST_DATABASE_URL`.\n- Its fixtures are tagged `QA6-` / `@qa-sh6.test` and removed afterwards. The SchoolDay table and the school timezone are snapshotted and restored.\n- It passed 4 runs in a row, and the dev DB was left unchanged.\n\n## Recommendation\n\nSend SH-6 back to Dev to finish TASK-9 to TASK-16, starting with the TimetableGrid, then the editor, then the seed (FR-41 to FR-44), because the e2e test needs the seed. Dev also needs to write a real SH-6 `dev-log.md` and `task-completion-markers.json`. The backend is ready for the UI and does not need rework.\n{\n  \"name\": \"schoolhub\",\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"engines\": {\n    \"node\": \">=18.18.0\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"dev\": \"next dev\",\n    \"build\": \"next build\",\n    \"start\": \"next start\",\n    \"lint\": \"next lint\",\n    \"typecheck\": \"tsc --noEmit\",\n    \"test\": \"vitest run\",\n    \"test:e2e\": \"playwright test\",\n    \"db:migrate\": \"prisma migrate dev\",\n    \"db:deploy\": \"prisma migrate deploy\",\n    \"db:seed\": \"tsx prisma/seed.ts\",\n    \"db:reset\": \"prisma migrate reset --force\",\n    \"worker:email\": \"tsx scripts/worker-email.ts\",\n    \"format\": \"prettier --write .\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@dnd-kit/core\": \"6.3.1\",\n    \"@emotion/react\": \"11.13.3\",\n    \"@emotion/styled\": \"11.13.0\",\n    \"@hookform/resolvers\": \"3.9.0\",\n    \"@mui/icons-material\": \"9.5.0\",\n    \"@mui/material\": \"9.5.0\",\n    \"@mui/material-nextjs\": \"9.5.0\",\n    \"@mui/x-charts\": \"9.5.0\",\n    \"@mui/x-data-grid\": \"9.5.0\",\n    \"@mui/x-date-pickers\": \"9.5.0\",\n    \"@prisma/client\": \"5.20.0\",\n    \"@react-email/components\": \"0.0.25\",\n    \"@react-email/render\": \"1.0.1\",\n    \"bcrypt\": \"^6.0.0\",\n    \"date-fns\": \"3.6.0\",\n    \"date-fns-tz\": \"3.2.0\",\n    \"next\": \"14.2.18\",\n    \"next-auth\": \"5.0.0-beta.25\",\n    \"nodemailer\": \"^6.9.14\",\n    \"papaparse\": \"^5.4.1\",\n    \"react\": \"18.3.1\",\n    \"react-dom\": \"18.3.1\",\n    \"react-hook-form\": \"7.53.0\",\n    \"react-is\": \"18.3.1\",\n    \"zod\": \"3.23.8\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@axe-core/playwright\": \"4.10.0\",\n    \"@playwright/test\": \"1.47.2\",\n    \"@testing-library/jest-dom\": \"6.5.0\",\n    \"@testing-library/react\": \"16.0.1\",\n    \"@testing-library/user-event\": \"14.5.2\",\n    \"@types/bcrypt\": \"^6.0.0\",\n    \"@types/eslint\": \"^8.56.10\",\n    \"@types/node\": \"20.14.10\",\n    \"@types/nodemailer\": \"^6.4.15\",\n    \"@types/papaparse\": \"^5.3.14\",\n    \"@types/react\": \"18.3.3\",\n    \"@types/react-dom\": \"18.3.0\",\n    \"@typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin\": \"7.16.1\",\n    \"@typescript-eslint/parser\": \"7.16.1\",\n    \"@vitejs/plugin-react\": \"4.3.1\",\n    \"eslint\": \"8.57.0\",\n    \"eslint-config-next\": \"14.2.18\",\n    \"jsdom\": \"25.0.0\",\n    \"prettier\": \"3.3.3\",\n    \"prisma\": \"5.20.0\",\n    \"tsx\": \"4.16.2\",\n    \"typescript\": \"5.5.4\",\n    \"vitest\": \"2.1.1\"\n  },\n  \"overrides\": {\n    \"react-is\": \"18.3.1\",\n    \"playwright-core\": \"1.47.2\"\n  }\n}\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Build SchoolHub with forge, one PRD per run, committing after each.\n# Usage: ./run.sh <workspace-dir> [start-index=0] [end-index=18] [extra forge flags...]\n# Example: ./run.sh ~/schoolhub            # everything, with approval gates\n#          ./run.sh ~/schoolhub 7 7        # just PRD-07\n#          ./run.sh ~/schoolhub 3 18 --autonomous\nset -euo pipefail\n\nWS=\"${1:?workspace dir required}\"; START=\"${2:-0}\"; END=\"${3:-18}\"; shift $(( $# < 3 ? $# : 3 ))\nPRD_DIR=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"$0\")\" && pwd)\"\nmkdir -p \"$WS\"\nWS=\"$(cd \"$WS\" && pwd)\"\n[ -d \"$WS/.git\" ] || git -C \"$WS\" init -q\n\nfor i in $(seq \"$START\" \"$END\"); do\n  n=$(printf '%02d' \"$i\")\n  prd=$(ls \"$PRD_DIR\"/\"$n\"-*.md)\n  mode=$([ \"$i\" -eq 0 ] && echo --greenfield || echo --brownfield)\n  echo \"=== SCH-0$n  $(basename \"$prd\") ===\"\n  (cd \"$WS\" && forge run --prd \"$prd\" --ticket \"SCH-0$n\" --workspace \"$WS\" --tech-stack react \"$mode\" \"$@\")\n  git -C \"$WS\" add -A\n  git -C \"$WS\" commit -qm \"SCH-0$n: $(head -1 \"$prd\" | sed 's/^# //')\" || echo \"(nothing to commit)\"\ndone\nservices:\n  postgres:\n    image: postgres:16\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    environment:\n      POSTGRES_DB: schoolhub\n      POSTGRES_USER: schoolhub\n      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: schoolhub\n    ports:\n      - '5432:5432'\n    volumes:\n      - schoolhub_postgres_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data\n\nvolumes:\n  schoolhub_postgres_data:\nimport { defineConfig } from '@playwright/test';\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  testDir: './tests/e2e',\n  fullyParallel: true,\n  reporter: 'list',\n  use: {\n    baseURL: process.env.APP_URL ?? 'http://localhost:3000',\n  },\n  webServer: {\n    command: 'npm run start',\n    url: process.env.APP_URL ?? 'http://localhost:3000',\n    reuseExistingServer: !process.env.CI,\n    timeout: 60_000,\n  },\n});","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eef66e53-e26d-4204-b561-7eec81d716ed","uuid":"4db635ff-9f3c-42b3-a561-0202c2a8bb92","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:35:00.300Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# Dev Log — SH-4 (PRD-04 Notifications & Email Infrastructure)\n\n## Iteration (continuation run, 2026-11-04)\n\nEarlier iterations left no source files and no dev-log, so this run started from TASK-1.\nEvery artifact uses ticketId `SH-4`, the id on all upstream artifacts. The prompt also said \"UNKNOWN\".\n\n### Progress so far\n- Generated the migration with `prisma migrate diff --from-schema-datasource --to-schema-datamodel` (equivalent to `migrate dev --create-only`, with no shadow DB). It is additive only: EmailStatus enum, 3 tables, 2 indexes, 2 FKs. Applied to the local dev DB with `migrate deploy`.\n- `react.cache` is undefined outside Next, so the email/notify code does not import `services/settings.ts`. `render.ts` exports `getEmailSchool()`, which reads the singleton directly.\n- The dispatcher's raw SQL uses `now() AT TIME ZONE 'UTC'` because the columns are `timestamp(3)` without a