{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjEvPhF3S5dP946HMNSy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LtFMWUzMMSWofLQ2u9T4wR","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub-prds/artifacts/ui-verification/ui-verification-report.md","content":"# UI Verification Report: SH-6 (PRD-06 Bell Schedule & Timetable)\n\n- **ticketId:** SH-6\n- **timestamp:** 2026-11-05T05:36:59Z\n- **status:** complete (the verification ran, and the UI is absent)\n- **Result:** 0 PASS, 19 FAIL, 1 BLOCKED, out of 20 UI-facing requirements\n- **Design reference:** none (there is no `figma-readiness.json`). The checks compare against the PRD text in `requirements.json`.\n\n## Headline\n\n**None of the SH-6 UI exists.** Every timetable page was rendered as a signed-in ADMIN, and each one returned **HTTP 404**. The checks were:\n- `/timetable`\n- `/admin/timetable`\n- `/admin/timetable/periods`\n\nThis confirms the QA finding: Dev stopped after TASK-8, the backend. TASK-9 to TASK-14 (grid, bell schedule, editor, personal, student and course views, navigation) were never built.\n\nThe backend that the UI would use does respond:\n- `GET /api/periods` returns 200 `{data:[]}`. It is empty because the seed (TASK-15) was not built either.\n- `GET /api/school-days` returns 200, with Mon–Fri teaching and a `slotCount` for each day.\n\n## How it was checked\n\n1. Started the project's own dev server (`npx next dev -p 3200`) against the local Postgres on :5433.\n2. Created a temporary ADMIN `uiv-sh6@test.local` and signed in through the next-auth credentials callback.\n3. Requested each route. The temporary user and its audit rows were deleted afterwards, and the dev server was stopped.\n4. Pages that cannot be reached without seed data (the student and course tabs) were checked against the route files and the tab registries in the source instead. These are marked FAIL, not PASS, because the code is provably missing.\n\n## Findings\n\n| Req | Surface | Verdict | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| FR-5 | Bell schedule `/admin/timetable/periods` | FAIL | 404. `page.tsx` and `BellScheduleEditor.tsx` are missing. |\n| FR-7 | Teaching-day ToggleButtons + confirm | FAIL | 404. Only the API exists (it returns slotCount per day). |\n| FR-15 | Timetable editor `/admin/timetable` | FAIL | 404. `TimetableEditor.tsx` is missing. |\n| FR-16 | TimetableGrid | FAIL | `src/components/TimetableGrid/` does not exist. |\n| FR-17 | Sidebar \"placed N\" + drop to place | FAIL | The host page returns 404, and the code is missing. |\n| FR-18 | Drag move / remove + confirm | FAIL | The host page returns 404. `@dnd-kit/core` is never imported. |\n| FR-19 | Clash tint + icon + tooltip | FAIL | The host page returns 404. The availability API exists. |\n| FR-20 | Snap-back + clash toast | FAIL | The host page returns 404, and the code is missing. |\n| FR-21 | Room Popover (free rooms) | FAIL | The host page returns 404. The free-rooms API exists. |\n| FR-22 | Keyboard \"Place course\" dialog | FAIL | The host page returns 404, and the code is missing. |\n| FR-23 | dnd-kit + MUI Paper/Card/Chip | FAIL | No components to inspect. |\n| FR-24 | Personal `/timetable` | FAIL | 404. `PersonalTimetable.tsx` is missing. |\n| FR-25 | Parent child selector | FAIL | `/timetable` returns 404. |\n| FR-26 | Week/Today + Now/Next badges | FAIL | `/timetable` returns 404. The `nowAndNext` helper exists but no UI uses it. |\n| FR-27 | Student \"Timetable\" tab | FAIL | `student-tabs.ts` has only `courses`, and the route directory does not exist. |\n| FR-28 | Course \"Schedule\" tab | FAIL | `course-tabs.ts` has only `overview` and `roster`, and there is no `schedule/` route. |\n| FR-29 | Print button + A4 print layout | FAIL | There is no grid to print, and the print components are missing. |\n| FR-32 | Nav entries (Timetable / editor / Bell schedule) | FAIL | Not in `navigation.ts` or the rendered dashboard HTML. |\n| NFR-4 | Accessibility signals | FAIL | Depends on FR-19, FR-22 and FR-26, which are all missing. |\n| NFR-16 | Cross-browser + print output | BLOCKED | There is no UI to check, and no browser was driven. |\n\n## Pre-existing issues seen while rendering (not SH-6 scope)\n\n- **MUI X version mismatch.** `@mui/x-internals` 9.15.0 is installed against `@mui/x-data-grid` 9.5.0. As a result:\n  - `/admin/sections` returns 500.\n  - After that, the dev server returns 500 on every request until it is restarted. This includes the timetable APIs, which can make them look broken when they are not.\n- **No login page.** `/login` returns 404, and `src/app/(auth)/` contains only `layout.tsx`. Users can only sign in through the API.\n\n## Recommendation\n\nSend SH-6 back to Dev for TASK-9 to TASK-16, then run this phase again. Once the seed (FR-41 to FR-44) exists, the re-run should drive a real browser:\n- Run `npx playwright install chromium`.\n- Render the editor drag, clash and toast flow, the student Today view, the parent child switch, and print preview.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2639,"cache_read_input_tokens":59837,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2639},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eef66e53-e26d-4204-b561-7eec81d716ed","uuid":"47cfd28f-ba31-468e-a467-3394d1931dd2","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:37:40.664Z","request_id":"req_011CgjEvPTrQjJ4e3ZDeTTmn","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01LtFMWUzMMSWofLQ2u9T4wR":{"file_path":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub-prds/artifacts/ui-verification/ui-verification-report.md","content":"# UI Verification Report: SH-6 (PRD-06 Bell Schedule & Timetable)\n\n- **ticketId:** SH-6\n- **