e rate is below SchoolSettings.attendanceAlertThreshold (default 90), sorted ascending, eac\nFR-34 | Add navigation entries: 'Attendance' for TEACHER (to /attendance/take) and 'Attendance' for ADMIN in the main group (to /admin/attendance). Students a\nFR-35 | API routes: GET /api/attendance/today; GET and PUT /api/attendance/register (course or section variant); GET /api/students/:id/attendance?from=&to=; G\nFR-36 | Zod validators live in src/lib/validators/attendance.ts and are shared by the register form and the API handlers (PUT body, query params, report filte\nFR-37 | The attendance service lives at src/server/attendance/attendance-service.ts, following the PRD-05 feature-subdirectory precedent.\nFR-38 | Seed: attendance sessions for 7A and 7B covering the 15 teaching days before the seed run date. Use a fixed RNG seed and roughly 94% present, 3% late \nFR-39 | Unit tests: rate calculation, the edit-window rule, and change detection for notifications (no duplicate on re-save).\nFR-40 | Integration tests: the register save transaction, enrollment validation, and the partial unique indexes.\nFR-41 | Playwright tests: the take-attendance flow on a mobile viewport (375 px), and a parent seeing the notification and the absence on the attendance calen\n['ticketId', 'timestamp', 'phase', 'version', 'prd', 'runMode', 'brownfieldFindings', 'functionalRequirements', 'nonFunctionalRequirements', 'overallConfidencePct', 'clarificationLog', 'status']\nls: artifacts/intake/figma-readiness.json: No such file or directory","is_error":true,"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WwhtqHMVyTpk9NSAuyVV5q"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b0d33c40-44ea-44a6-8793-0fcbf67c071f","uuid":"2619926b-6564-49be-8818-85b0b7c1bf69","timestamp":"2026-11-06T06:16:06.837Z","tool_use_result":"Error: Exit code 1\nscreenshots\nui-verification-report.json\nui-verification-report.md\n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-1\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-05T17:23:25.497Z\",\n  \"succeeded\": false,\n  \"phases\": {\n    