bers, course 'UIV Attendance' enrolled 30 days back, and timetable slots on every weekday. attendanceMode was set to BOTH for the run and restored to PER_PERIOD. All fixtures were deleted afterwards (verified 0 rows). Viewports: 360×740 (teacher), 375×667 (parent), 1280×800 (desktop and admin). One pass ran with the shipped CSP enforced; the rest used bypassCSP:true, the same as QA and the e2e spec. Screenshots are in artifacts/ui-verification/screenshots/ and raw probe output is in artifacts/ui-verification/uiv-raw.json. There is no figma-readiness.json, so the checks are against the PRD and requirements.json text only. Note: the first DataGrid compile failure leaves `next dev` returning 500 for every later request, so DataGrid pages were visited last.\",\n  \"blockingIssues\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"UIV-1\",\n      \"severity\": \"BLOCKER\",\n      \"summa\n{\n \"today\": \"2026-11-06\",\n \"results\": {\n  \"csp-enforced\": {\n   \"hydrated\": false,\n   \"cspErrors\": 10\n  },\n  \"teacher-landing-360\": {\n   \"url\": \"/attendance/take\",\n   \"status\": 200,\n   \"consoleErrors\": [],\n   \"text\": \"SchoolHub 0 TT Take attendance Friday 6 November 2026 Register date 11/ 06/ 2026 Register date Daily register – uiv-att Not taken TAKE ATTENDANCE UIV Attendance – uiv-att uiv-att · 00:00–23:59 · Now Not taken TAKE ATTENDANCE\"\n  },\n  \"landing-entries\": {\n   \"course\": 1,\n   \"daily\": 1,\n   \"notTaken\": 2\n  },\n  \"teacher-register-empty-360\": {\n   \"url\": \"/attendance/take/cmw4ltbvo000eg2c288uzsdb7?date=2026-11-06&periodId=cmw4ltbvg0007g2c2zh01qnge\",\n   \"status\": 200,\n   \"consoleErrors\": [],\n   \"text\": \"SchoolHub 0 TT Take attendance / Register UIV Attendance uiv-att · uiv-att · Friday 6 Nov 2026 Present 0 Absent 0 Late 0 Unmarked 3 MARK ALL PRESENT AA Alex Absent P A L E LL Lee Late P A L E PP Pat Present P A L E 3 students not marked SAVE\"\n  },\n  \"save-disabled-initially\": true,\n  \"mark-all-keeps-existing\": {\n   \"present2\