{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgo3BD8Y9YiMLePoadnfb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013GkShT28wXiLyzLtTHChKL","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json, datetime\nNI = \"Not implemented: \"\ndef f(fr, surface, notes): return {\"requirementId\": fr, \"surface\": surface, \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"notes\": notes}\nC404 = \"`next dev` returned 404 'Page not found' for all four roles (teacher 1280, student/parent 375). The page file does not exist, and the dev log shows no compile step for the route. By contrast, the existing /courses/[courseId] route compiled.\"\nfindings = [\n f(\"FR-13\",\"FileUpload component (src/components/FileUpload/FileUpload.tsx)\", NI+\"the component file is absent, so there is nothing to render and no page mounts it. No drop zone, progress bar or file list.\"),\n f(\"FR-14\",\"FileList component (src/components/FileList/FileList.tsx)\", NI+\"the component file is absent, so no attachment download links render anywhere.\"),\n f(\"FR-19\",\"Content status badge (src/components/content/StatusChip.tsx)\", NI+\"StatusChip.tsx is absent, and the Content tab that would show Draft/Scheduled/Published badges returns 404.\"),\n f(\"FR-20\",\"Course 'Content' tab (/courses/[courseId]/content)\", NI+C404+\" src/config/course-tabs.ts has no 'content' entry, so the tab bar shows only Overview/Roster/Attendance. Screenshots: teacher-course-content-1280.png, student-course-content-375.png.\"),\n f(\"FR-21\",\"Student module/course progress bars and 'Continue' button\", NI+\"these belong to the Content tab (ContentOutline.tsx is absent). The student's /courses/[id]/content returned 404 (student-course-content-375.png).\"),\n f(\"FR-22\",\"Teacher Content-tab controls (Add module, module menu, Add lesson)\", NI+\"ContentOutline.tsx is absent; the route returned 404 for the teacher (teacher-course-content-1280.png).\"),\n f(\"FR-23\",\"Drag-and-drop / up-down lesson reordering\", NI+\"there is no ContentOutline UI, and api/courses/[id]/content/reorder/route.ts is also absent.\"),\n f(\"FR-24\",\"Module delete confirmation dialog (type the title)\", NI+\"there is no Content tab and no api/modules/[id] route. The shared ConfirmDialog exists but is unused by SH-8.\"),\n f(\"FR-25\",\"Lesson editor page (/courses/[courseId]/lessons/[lessonId]/edit)\", NI+\"edit/page.tsx and LessonEditor.tsx are absent. The teacher got 404 (teacher-lesson-edit-1280.png).\"),\n f(\"FR-26\",\"Editor toolbar image insert and missing-alt-text warning\", NI+\"LessonEditor.tsx is absent.\"),\n f(\"FR-27\",\"Editor attachments and links sections\", NI+\"LessonEditor.tsx and PATCH /api/lessons/[id] are absent.\"),\n f(\"FR-28\",\"Save draft / Publish now / Schedule controls with date-time picker\", NI+\"LessonEditor.tsx is absent. Only the server-side 'schedule must be in the future' validator exists (content.ts).\"),\n f(\"FR-29\",\"Autosave every 10s, 'Saved HH:mm' indicator and unsaved-changes warning\", NI+\"LessonEditor.tsx is absent.\"),\n f(\"FR-30\",\"Video embed (16:9 privacy-enhanced iframe, VideoEmbed.tsx)\", NI+\"VideoEmbed.tsx is absent and no lesson viewer renders it. The URL parser exists and is unit-tested, but it has no visual surface.\"),\n f(\"FR-31\",\"MarkdownView component (react-markdown mapped to MUI)\", NI+\"src/components/MarkdownView/MarkdownView.tsx and its test are absent.\"),\n f(\"FR-32\",\"Lesson viewer (/courses/[courseId]/lessons/[lessonId])\", NI+C404+\" Screenshots: teacher-lesson-view-1280.png, student-lesson-view-375.png.\"),\n f(\"FR-33\",\"Student 'Mark as complete' button\", NI+\"the lesson viewer (LessonViewerActions.tsx) and /api/lessons/[id]/progress are absent.\"),\n f(\"FR-34\",\"Teacher 'Progress' drawer on the lesson viewer\", NI+\"the lesson viewer and GET /api/lessons/[id]/progress are absent.\"),\n f(\"FR-35\",\"Student 'Learning' tab (/students/[id]/learning)\", NI+\"the student got 404 for the seeded student's real id (student-learning-375.png). Only the attendance/ and courses/ subroutes exist under students/[id], and /api/students/[id]/learning is absent.\"),\n f(\"FR-36\",\"Parent read-only course content and lessons\", NI+\"the parent got 404 on /courses/[id]/content (parent-course-content-375.png). No content or lesson views exist for any role.\"),\n f(\"FR-39\",\"Schedule-control tooltip ('Scheduled lessons appear automatically without a notification.')\", NI+\"the Schedule control is part of the missing LessonEditor.\"),\n f(\"FR-40\",\"Logo FileUpload on school settings\", NI+\"there is no settings page and no FileUpload component. The logo file context and serving (backend) exist.\"),\n f(\"FR-42\",\"Admin school settings page (/admin/settings/school) and nav entry\", NI+\"the admin got 404 (admin-settings-school-1280.png). This path takes no id, so the 404 is unambiguous. src/app/(app)/admin/ contains only attendance, courses, email-log and sections.\"),\n]\nr = {\n \"ticketId\":\"SH-8\",\"timestamp\":datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).strftime(\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\"),\n \"phase\":\"ui-verification\",\"version\":\"1.0\",\"status\":\"complete\",\n \"summary\": {\"uiFacingRequirements\": len(findings), \"pass\": 0, \"fail\": len(findings), \"blocked\": 0},\n \"method\": \"Ran `next dev -p 3300` against the local Postgres (:5433). The existing :3000/:3001 servers were left alone. A throwaway Playwright driver (/tmp, outside the repo) signed in as the seeded teacher, student, parent and admin and visited every SH-8 page route at 1280×800 (teacher/admin) or 375×667 (student/parent), using bypassCSP as earlier QA did. Every SH-8 UI path in file-ownership-matrix.json was also checked on disk. The DB has 0 courses, 0 modules and 0 lessons; the FR-47 seed content was not built, so course-scoped routes used a placeholder course id. The 404 comes from a missing route, not a missing course: the route files are absent, Next compiled nothing for them (the 404 came back in 50–260 ms), and the existing /courses/[courseId] route did compile. The design reference figma-readiness.json does not exist, so checks are against requirements.json and the PRD text only. Screenshots are in artifacts/ui-verification/screenshots/ and raw probe output is in uiv-raw.json.\",\n \"blockingIssues\": [\n  {\"id\":\"UIV-1\",\"severity\":\"BLOCKER\",\"summary\":\"No SH-8 UI is implemented. 19 of the 19 UI files in file-ownership-matrix.json are missing (pages, FileUpload, FileList, MarkdownView, StatusChip, VideoEmbed), so every content, lesson, learning and settings route returns 404 for every role. This matches QA's FAIL (TASK-10 to TASK-21 not built). The Dev phase must be rerun before UI verification can say anything about layout or behaviour.\"},\n  {\"id\":\"UIV-2\",\"severity\":\"MAJOR\",\"summary\":\"Seed content (FR-47) is missing; the DB has 0 courses. Even once the UI is built, verification will need seeded MATH-7A/ENG-7A content or fixtures.\"},\n  {\"id\":\"UIV-3\",\"severity\":\"INFO\",\"summary\":\"Carry-over, not caused by SH-8: (a) the shipped CSP blocks hydration, so runs use bypassCSP; (b) the MUI X version skew makes DataGrid pages 500 and leaves `next dev` returning 500 for every later request. Observed again when probing /courses/[id]/attendance as a control.\"}\n ],\n \"findings\": findings,\n \"blockedReason\": None\n}\njson.dump(r, open(\"artifacts/ui-verification/ui-verification-report.json\",\"w\"), indent=2)\nprint(len(findings))\nEOF\npython3 -m json.tool artifacts/ui-verification/ui-verification-report.json >/dev/null && echo valid","description":"Write UI verification JSON report"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":848,"cache_read_input_tokens":63372,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":848},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","i