content` | 404 |\n| Student | 375×667 | `/courses/:id/lessons/:lessonId` | 404 |\n| Student | 375×667 | `/students/<real Sam id>/learning` | 404 |\n| Parent | 375×667 | `/courses/:id/content` | 404 |\n| Admin | 1280×800 | `/admin/settings/school` | 404 (no id, so unambiguous) |\n| Admin | 1280×800 | `/dashboard` (control) | 200, renders |\n\nSign-in worked for all four seeded accounts and redirected to `/dashboard`.\n\n## Findings\n\n| Requirement | Surface | Verdict | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n{rows}\n\nNon-visual requirements (FR-1 to FR-12, FR-15 to FR-18, FR-37, FR-38, FR-41, FR-43 to FR-48) are backend, API, data or test items. They are covered by QA, not by this phase.\n\n## What is needed before re-running UI verification\n\n1. Re-run Dev for TASK-10 to TASK-21: the content service and API routes, the UI components, the Content tab, the lesson viewer and editor, the Learning tab, `/admin/settings/school` and the `course-tabs.ts` entry.\n2. Build the FR-47 seed content (MATH-7A/ENG-7A modules and lessons, the seed PDF), so the pages have data to render.\n3. Optional but useful: fix the carry-over CSP and MUI X version skew (UIV-3). With the CSP fixed, verification can run without `bypassCSP`; with the version skew fixed, a DataGrid page no longer leaves the dev server broken.\n\"\"\"\nopen(\"artifacts/ui-verification/ui-verification-report.md\",\"w\").write(md)\nEOF\nls -la --time-style=full-iso artifacts/ui-verification/ 2>/dev/null || ls -lT artifacts/ui-verification/","description":"Write Markdown report last and confirm timestamps"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":404,"cache_read_input_tokens":68206,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":404},"output_tokens":47,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_manag