{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgo3ZR31Y2N7xrGWtQKso","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I ran UI verification for SH-8 and the result is **FAIL**: none of the user interface for this ticket was built. All 23 screen-related requirements failed (0 pass, 0 blocked).\n\n- **What's missing:** Dev's SH-8 plan assigns 14 UI files, and all 14 are absent from the codebase:\n  - the content-tab, lesson viewer, lesson editor, learning-tab and school-settings pages;\n  - the file upload, file list, Markdown rendering, status badge and video embed components.\n\n  Eight of the content API routes those pages would use are also missing.\n- **What I saw when rendering:** I started the app on port 3300 and signed in as the seeded teacher, student, parent and admin. Every SH-8 page returned the app's \"404 Page not found\":\n  - the course Content tab;\n  - the lesson editor and lesson viewer;\n  - the student Learning tab;\n  - `/admin/settings/school`.\n\n  The database has no courses, so course pages used a placeholder ID. The 404s still mean the pages don't exist: the files aren't there and Next never compiled those routes. The existing course page did compile. The admin settings page takes no ID, so its 404 is unambiguous.\n- **This matches QA.** The QA report says the backend for file storage works (FR-1 to FR-12) but everything from TASK-10 to TASK-21 was never built. The Dev phase never wrote an SH-8 log, so `dev-log.md` is still SH-7's.\n- **Seed data:** the FR-47 course content seed wasn't built either. Even once the UI exists, verification will need seeded courses or test fixtures to have anything to show.\n- **Older problems seen again, not caused by SH-8:** the site's security policy (CSP) stops pages from becoming interactive in a real browser, so my test run bypassed it, as QA did. Visiting any table (DataGrid) page also crashes the dev server, which then returns errors for every later request.\n- **No design file:** `figma-readiness.json` doesn't exist, so I checked only against the requirements and PRD text.\n\nThe next step is to rerun Dev for TASK-10 to TASK-21 and the seed content, then run this phase again.\n\nThe old SH-7 report files and screenshots have been replaced. The test script I used is in `/tmp/uiv-sh8/`, outside the repo, and I stopped the port-3300 server.\n\nFiles are in `artifacts/ui-verification/`:\n- ui-verification-report.json\n- ui-verification-report.md (written last)\n- uiv-raw.json\n- screenshots/"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":70365,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4236bb9b-3e91-459f-a600-1de35f9962e2","uuid":"154ad34a-103e-4dae-8134-a31b1f1ec123","timestamp":"2026-11-07T05:50:54.517Z","request_id":"req_011Cgo3ZQ6TT2XTNtFbK5qmC"}
