{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgrvBvjXNccTm8XY1BvUq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KQkaRpYnjUxZUevXadEcjr","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd ~/Documents/forge/schoolhub/artifacts/ui-verification && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json\nr=json.load(open('ui-verification-report.json'))\nL=[\"# UI Verification Report — SH-9 (PRD-09 Assignments & Submissions)\",\"\",\nf\"- **ticketId:** {r['ticketId']}\",f\"- **timestamp:** {r['timestamp']}\",f\"- **status:** {r['status']}\",\n\"- **Result:** all 30 UI-facing requirements **PASS** (0 FAIL, 0 BLOCKED). There is 1 pre-existing platform defect (**PLATFORM-TOAST**, FAIL, not SH-9-owned) and 2 minor observations.\",\"\",\n\"## Headline\",\"\",\n\"1. **The SH-9 UI works end to end in a production build.** I checked every surface: the teacher table, create/edit form, rubric builder, duplicate dialog, grading workspace, student course tab, detail page, submit flow, receipt, returned views, `/assignments` for student, parent and teacher, and the student profile tab. All rendered with no console or page errors. Every state change I made through the UI (grade, return, return-all, exempt on/off, offline grade, submit) was confirmed in the DB.\",\n\"2. **PLATFORM-TOAST (fix recommended, outside SH-9 scope).** `ToastProvider` loses queued toasts. After the first toast exits, `open` stays `false`, so the next one never shows until a later `showToast()`, which then shows a stale message. In SH-9's fast-grading flow (Ctrl+Enter, then Save & return, or Save, then Return all), teachers get no confirmation for the second action, even though it succeeded. A one-line fix is likely: `setOpen(true)` in `handleExited` when more toasts are queued. This may be the root of the pre-existing `useToast.test.tsx` failure.\",\n\"3. **Minor:** UIV-2, the NO_SUBMISSION assignment appears under the course tab's \\\"Past due\\\" heading. UIV-3, scores display as `16.2` rather than `16.20`.\",\"\",\n\"## Method\",\"\",r['method'],\"\",\n\"## Findings\",\"\",\"| Req | Surface | Verdict | Notes |\",\"|---|---|---|---|\"]\nfor f in r['findings']:\n  L.append(f\"| {f['requirementId']} | {f['surface']} | **{f['verdict']}** | {f['notes'].replace('|','\\\\|')} |\")\nL+=[\"\",\"## Observations\",\"\"]+[f\"- **{o['id']}** ({o['severity']}): {o['summary']}\" for o in r['observations']]\nL+=[\"\",\"## Not exercised in this pass\",\"\"]+[f\"- {x}\" for x in r['notExercised']]\nL+=[\"\",\"## Evidence\",\"\",\"- Screenshots: `artifacts/ui-verification/screenshots/` (25 PNGs; `*-1280` = teacher/desktop, `*-375` = student/parent mobile).\",\"- Raw probe output: `artifacts/ui-verification/uiv-raw.json`. Its only `ok:false` entry, `teacher-save-and-return`, is the missing toast (PLATFORM-TOAST). The same step's DB poll confirmed RETURNED before the toast wait timed out.\",\"\"]\nopen('ui-verification-report.md','w').write(\"\\n\".join(L))\nEOF\nls -la --time-style=full-iso *.json *.md 2>/dev/null || ls -lT *.json *.md","description":"Write ui-verification-report.md last"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5515,"cache_read_input_tokens":111690,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5515,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":34,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e5bdbc6d-8407-44d1-9b1e-f6d173da0eb5","uuid":"d514f137-354b-4118-8895-193173e82f0b","timestamp":"2026-11-09T06:56:40.391Z","request_id":"req_011CgrvBvBJDpL7deR2HBJ9m","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01KQkaRpYnjUxZUevXadEcjr":{"command":"cd ~/Documents/forge/schoolhub/artifacts/ui-verification && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json\nr=json.load(open('ui-verification-report.json'))\nL=[\"# UI Verification Report — SH-9 (PRD-09 Assignments & Submissions)\",\"\",\nf\"- **ticketId:** {r['ticketId']}\",f\"- **timestamp:** {r['timestamp']}\",f\"- **status:** {r['status']}\",\n\"- **Result:** all 30 UI-facing requirements **PASS** (0 FAIL, 0 BLOCKED). There is 1 pre-existing platform defect (**PLATFORM-TOAST**, FAIL, not SH-9-owned) and 2 minor observations.\",\"\",\n\"## Headline\",\"\",\n\"1. **The SH-9 UI works end to end in a production build.** I checked every surface: the teacher table, create/edit form, rubric builder, duplicate dialog, grading workspace, student course tab, detail page, submit flow, receipt, returned views, `/assignments` for student, parent and teacher, and the student profile tab. All rendered with no console or page errors. Every state change I made through the UI (grade, return, return-all, exempt on/off, offline grade, submit) was confirmed in the DB.\",\n\"2. **PLATFORM-TOAST (fix recommended, outside SH-9 scope).** `ToastProvider` loses queued toasts. After the first toast exits, `open` stays `false`, so the next one never shows until a later `showToast()`, which then shows a stale message. In SH-9's fast-grading flow (Ctrl+Enter, then Save & return, or Save, then Return all), teachers get no confirmation for the second action, even though it succeeded. A one-line fix is likely: `setOpen(true)` in `handleExited` when more toasts are queued. This may be the root of the pre-existing `useToast.test.tsx` failure.\",\n\"3. **Minor:** UIV-2, the NO_SUBMISSION assignment appears under the course tab's \\\"Past due\\\" heading. UIV-3, scores display as `16.2` rather than `16.20`.\",\"\",\n\"## Method\",\"\",r['method'],\"\",\n\"## Findings\",\"\",\"| Req | Surface | Verdict | Notes |\",\"|---|---|---|---|\"]\nfor f in r['findings']:\n  L.append(f\"| {f['requirementId']} | {f['surface']} | **{f['verdict']}** | {f['notes'].replace('|','\\\\|')} |\")\nL+=[\"\",\"## Observations\",\"\"]+[f\"- **{o['id']}** ({o['severity']}): {o['summary']}\" for o in r['observations']]\nL+=[\"\",\"## Not exercised in this pass\",\"\"]+[f\"- {x}\" for x in r['notExercised']]\nL+=[\"\",\"## Evidence\",\"\",\"- Screenshots: `artifacts/ui-verification/screenshots/` (25 PNGs; `*-1280` = teacher/desktop, `*-375` = student/parent mobile).\",\"- Raw probe output: `artifacts/ui-verification/uiv-raw.json`. Its only `ok:false` entry, `teacher-save-and-return`, is the missing toast (PLATFORM-TOAST). The same step's DB poll confirmed RETURNED before the toast wait timed out.\",\"\"]\nopen('ui-verification-report.md','w').write(\"\\n\".join(L))\nEOF\nls -la --time-style=full-iso *.json *.md 2>/dev/null || ls -lT *.json *.md","description":"Write ui-verification-report.md last"}}}
